            "value": "<p>Overall, there was an increase in the proportion of Australian exports to India and China, with the most dramatic rise being seen in the latter, making it the largest export destination for Australia by the end of the period. In contrast, exports to the US and Japan experienced a decrease over the given timeframe.&nbsp;</p>",
